    <div class="section-headline">Nobody knows your business like <em>your people.</em></div>
    <p>Not a consultant who studied it for two weeks. Not a software vendor. That is exactly why they are the ones we train. Your team already knows where the time goes: the re-keying, the follow-ups, the reports nobody has hours for. We hand them the tool to get that time back.</p>
