          <div class="step-meta">On site &nbsp;·&nbsp; 3 to 4 hours</div>
          <div class="step-desc">We teach the build process on your actual workflows. Everyone in the room picks a real task that eats their time and starts a build on it before the session ends. Nobody leaves with theory.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <div class="step-title">Session Two</div>
          <div class="step-meta">About one week later &nbsp;·&nbsp; 3 to 4 hours</div>
          <div class="step-desc">How did the first build go. What are you stuck on. We work through the hangups, answer what came up during the week, and grow the skillset from there. Your team leaves self-sufficient.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <div class="step-title">Session Three</div>
          <div class="step-meta">Optional add-on &nbsp;·&nbsp; Build session</div>
          <div class="step-desc">A build-your-own-solutions working session. The team brings the next round of problems and we build the fixes together, in the room.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

